      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so when you say their legitimacy is \"compromised,\" do you think there's any real way to fix it from within the current system, or are we basically looking at a situation where the judiciary is fundamentally broken because it's become a partisan tool?",
      "source": "evaluator"
